  test/review.test.ts,project,Review merge proof tests
close_reason: "Review state is a record that merges per field, proven by merging two real branches: different fields from two reviewers both survive, both reviewers-set additions survive, and a genuinely conflicting scalar is still reported as a conflict while the other fields merge."
